|skill        = R
|icon         = Cannon Barrage.png
|blurbicon         = Cannon Barrage.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Gangplank}} orders a cannon bombardment to the target location, each blast deals {{as|magic damage}} and {{tip|slow|slows}} enemies within.
|blurb2       = '''Gangplank''' can improve ''Cannon Barrage'' by purchasing upgrades in the shop with {{ai|Silver Serpents|Gangplank}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Gangplank''' shoots a flare into the air, signaling his ship off-shore to fire upon the target location, calling down 12 waves of cannonballs in clusters of 3 every 2 seconds, each wave in a cluster hitting {{fd|0.25}} seconds after the other, and granting {{tip|sight}} of the area for the duration. Each wave deals {{as|magic damage}} to all enemies within the area and {{tip|slow|slows}} them by 30% for {{fd|0.5}} seconds.
|leveling    = {{st|Magic Damage Per Wave|{{ap|40 to 100}} {{as|(+ 10% AP)}}|Magic Damage Per Cluster|{{ap|40*3 to 100*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*3}}% AP)}}}}
{{st|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|40*12 to 100*12}} {{as|(+ {{ap|10*12}}% AP)}}}}
